OL,3,GNEWSANew appeal over body found in
OL,4,Areservoir in wetsuit two years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have renewed an appeal over a
OL,7,Fman whose body was found in a reservoir
OL,8,Fwearing a wetsuit two years ago.
OL,10,FOfficers believed he had been in the
OL,11,Fwater up to 12 weeks when a dog walker
OL,12,Fdiscovered the body at Claerwen
OL,13,FReservoir in Powys on 17 October 2024.
OL,15,FThe discovery sparked extensive police
OL,16,Fsearches and international appeals, but
OL,17,Fnobody came forward.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
